                >
                  50 characters maximum
                </p>
                <div
                  class=""
                >
                  <input
                    class="govuk-input govuk-input--width-30 govuk-product-name-input__inner__input"
                    id="purchase-method-name"
                    maxlength="50"
                    name="name"
                    type="text"
                    value=""
                  />
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <input
              class="govuk-button"
              id="continue-button"
              type="submit"
              value="Add purchase method"
            />
          </form>
        </div>
        <div
          class="govuk-grid-column-one-third"
        >
          <h1
            class="govuk-heading-s"
          >
            What is a purchase method?
          </h1>
          <p
            class="govuk-body"
          >
            To create NeTEx for your fares, you need to provide the following:
          </p>
          <ol
